 reproduces the reported pre-summary TimeoutExpired boundary; independent hypothesis investigator is still assessing rivals before RCA.","timestamp":1786890026725090001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Phase 1 exit / Phase 2 test design\n\nCaller-dependency sweep: expected post-fix behavior is that every assert_nodes_do_not_mutate_external_store child owns a private basetemp and never performs pytest retention cleanup in the user-global root. The complete caller set is tests/unit/test_test_suite_store_isolation.py plus the two cases in tests/unit/test_test_suite_store_isolation_heldout.py. All three depend only on child return status and the ambient tracker HEAD/directory invariants; temp-root location is incidental. No behavioral dependency blocks repair.\n\nTest contract card:\nauthoritative_contract: tests/unit/test_test_suite_store_isolation.py:8-14 and tests/_store_isolation.py:19-46 require the selected node to complete within the bounded child run without changing ambient tracker HEAD/directories.\ntrigger_preconditions: PYTEST_DEBUG_TEMPROOT contains unlocked numbered pytest-0..pytest-3 directories; a sentinel in a cleanup-eligible directory proves the dangerous shared state exists.\nproduction_path: assert_nodes_do_not_mutate_external_store -> real captured Python/pytest subprocess -> pytest temp-path session-finish cleanup.\ntest_tier: parent/child subprocess; one tier lower cannot exercise pytest session-finish or global numbered-root selection.\nobservable_postcondition: the helper returns successfully, the exact sentinel and shared numbered-directory set remain unchanged, and the helper's existing ambient tracker assertions pass.\nci_gate: collected/executed by the default unit suite and make test.\nnegative_control: the defect-seeded mutation is omission of the private --basetemp; the fixture precondition plus the current RED deletion gives the contrast without a timing oracle.\ncollateral_invariants: ambient tracker HEAD and directory set remain exact (existing helper); unrelated shared pytest sentinel bytes and entries remain exact.\nfault_injection: real cleanup-eligible numbered pytest directories under an isolated PYTEST_DEBUG_TEMPROOT; no sleeps or mocked cleanup.","timestamp":1786891225395284001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"RED oracle proven before repair: tests/unit/test_test_suite_store_isolation.py::test_nested_pytest_does_not_clean_shared_numbered_temp_root collected and executed under pytest/default unit selection. It drove the real helper and child pytest with cleanup-eligible pytest-0..3 shared directories. Current code failed at the exact contractual assertion: `nested pytest deleted another run's temp tree`; the sentinel precondition was true before entry. Runtime 1.69s, so the oracle is deterministic and non-timing-based. Next: remove this held-out test from the fixer's filesystem, dispatch only the RCA/evidence/reproduction/contract card, then restore the oracle for GREEN.","timestamp":1786891288545791001}],"created_at":1786888217272739001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"130a4f3d-d9e0-4354-b733-7edaf2c300ee","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"bf7c-333e-29b0-4ee4"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","bf7c-333e-29b0-4ee4"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"0bd6-4729-e79e-433b","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Root-cause extras store-isolation pytest shutdown timeout","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["bad5c254-2094-4f11-8832-393181a3664e","130a4f3d-d9e0-4354-b733-7edaf2c300ee","f90e5412-3a67-4db5-8